     2080   end.
     2081   for each rbfps_arh-fin-doc-schet where rbfps_arh-fin-doc-schet.host-code        = bfps_arh-fin-doc-schet.host-code        and
     2082                                          rbfps_arh-fin-doc-schet.cli-type         = parpayer-type                           and
